On the e-commerce example, I used CurrentFilters to do it :

```js
<CurrentFilters
        theme={{
          root: 'CurrentFilters',
          filters: {
            display: 'none',
          },
          clearAll: 'CurrentFilters__clearAll btn',
        }}
        translations={{
          clearAll: 'Clear all filters',
        }}
      />
```
